{"product_id":"powerful-presentations","title":"Powerful Presentations","description":"\u003cp\u003eMost people at some time in their professional lives finds themselves faced with the prospect of making a presentation to a live audience. This immensely practical book, lively and fun to read, will instill confidence by showing how to:  build rapport with the audience  create a striking and lasting impression  structure and deliver the presentation  use visual aids and props to best effect  adapt presentations for different cultures Essential reading for the novice and seasoned speaker alike, this book will ensre that anyone can come across with real impact every time. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:137 x 218  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Jons Ehrenborg | John Mattock \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780749435738 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 128\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43641285640345,"sku":"16RD9780749435738","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/49a61eff7e26b8cdb4f7c74c4b144323.jpg?v=1701677677","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/powerful-presentations","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}